     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>How about this (it is not an optimal solution):</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read_csv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;heatmap.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> gather</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>       mutate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>       ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_point</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Kavee<br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/72dc8224919e9/Rplot03.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Rplot03.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"264\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/72dc8224919e9/Rplot01.png?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Rplot01.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"264\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p></div></div>"
